cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "For this private review draft, cite the project and the exact Git commit."
title: "Unbounded minimum Scott ranks for Boolean algebras"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Boolean Scott Spectral Gaps project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SerafimBatzoglou/boolean-scott-spectral-gaps"
keywords:
  - Boolean algebras
  - Scott rank
  - infinitary logic
  - Lean
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization showing that for every countable ordinal b, some
  satisfiable pure Boolean sentence of complexity Pi_(omega+4) has no
  countable model of Scott rank at most b.
